{"report_nm": "[기재정정]투자설명서(집합투자증권)(우리KOSPI200인덱스청년형장기소득공제증권자투자신탁(주식))", "parsed": {"risk_grade": 1, "risk_label": "매우 높은 위험", "fund_code": "E1884", "offer_units": "투자신탁 수익증권 10조좌", "_nodes": 3}, "nodes": ["정 정 신 고 (보고)", "투 자 설 명 서", "[ 본 문 ]"], "html": [["정정신고(보고)", "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\">\r\n<HTML style='border:0'>\r\n<HEAD>\r\n<TITLE></TITLE>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\" >\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-TextLayoutMetrics\" content=\"gdi\" >\r\n<META http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/report_xml.css\">\r\n</HEAD>\r\n<BODY bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n<P><BR/></P>\r\n<P class='correction'><A name='toc1'>정 정 신 고 (보고)</A></P>\r\n<TABLE class='nb' width='600'>\r\n<COLGROUP>\r\n<COL width='600'></COL>\r\n</COLGROUP>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR height='30'>\r\n  <TD width='591' height='23' valign='TOP'><BR/></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='30'>\r\n  <TD width='591' height='23' align='RIGHT' valign='TOP' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;'>2026년 10월 14일</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n</TBODY>\r\n</TABLE>\r\n<P><BR/></P>\r\n<P style='font-size:14pt;'>1. 정정대상 공시서류 : 투자설명서</P>\r\n<P><BR/></P>\r\n<P style='font-size:14pt;'>2. 정정대상 공시서류의 최초제출일 : 2023.04.07</P>\r\n<P><BR/></P>\r\n<P style='font-size:14pt;'>3. 정정요구ㆍ명령 관련 여부 : 아니오<BR/><BR/></P>\r\n<P style='font-size:14pt;'>4. 정정사항</P>\r\n<TABLE border='1' width='623'>\r\n<COLGROUP>\r\n<COL width='104'></COL>\r\n<COL width='260'></COL>\r\n<COL width='259'></COL>\r\n</COLGROUP>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR height='28'>\r\n  <TD width='95' height='21' align='CENTER' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;background-color:#DAEEF3;'>구분</TD>\r\n  <TD width='251' height='21' align='CENTER' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;background-color:#DAEEF3;'>변경 전</TD>\r\n  <TD width='250' height='21' align='CENTER' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;background-color:#DAEEF3;'>변경 후</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='70'>\r\n  <TD width='95' height='63' valign='TOP' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;'>기준일자 변경에 따른 업데이트</TD>\r\n  <TD width='251' height='63' valign='TOP' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;'>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;'>[요약정보] 투자비용, 투자실적추이(연평균수익률), 운용전문인력</P>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;'>-</P>\r\n</TD>\r\n  <TD width='250' height='63' valign='TOP' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;'>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;'>[요약정보] 투자비용, 투자실적추이(연평균수익률), 운용전문인력</P>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;'>기준일자 변경에 따른 업데이트</P>\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='49'>\r\n  <TD width='95' height='42' valign='TOP' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;'>운용전문인력 변경</TD>\r\n  <TD width='251' height='42' valign='TOP' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;'>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;'>[요약정보] 운용전문인력</P>\r\n<P style='font-size:10pt;text-align:left;'><SPAN style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;'>부책임 :&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-weight:bold;'>김기범</SPAN><SPAN style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;'>, 이채형, 김지윤</SPAN><BR/>\r\n</P>\r\n</TD>\r\n  <TD width='250' height='42' valign='TOP' style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;'>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-size:10pt;text-align:left;'>[요약정보] 운용전문인력</P>\r\n<P style='font-size:10pt;text-align:left;'><SPAN style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;'>부책임 :&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"바탕\", Batang;font-weight:bold;'